add(R, `다음 대화의 (A)~(E) 중, 주어진 문장이 들어갈 알맞은 곳은?\n\nI suggest you join my basketball club.\n\nB: How often do you play basketball? (A)\nG: I play once a week. (B) I want to play more often.\nB: (C) We play three times a week.\nG: (D) That sounds good! It'll be fun to play with you. (E)`, '3', ABCDE);
