add(R, `다음 주어진 대화에 이어질 순서로 알맞은 것은?\n\nW: Hello. Welcome to Sports World. May I help you?\nB: Yes, I came to register for a swimming class.\n\n(A) I see. How often do you want to take classes?\n(B) That sounds good. I'd like to sign up for that class. How big is the class?\n(C) Yes, it is. I don't know how to swim at all.\n(D) I want to take classes twice a week. I'd like to take classes on weekdays and not on weekends.\n(E) That's perfect.\n(F) Is this your first time taking swimming lessons?\n(G) The class has a limit of 10 people.\n(H) Then, I suggest that you take the Beginner 2 class. This class meets on Tuesdays and Thursdays.`, '4', ['(A)-(D)-(H)-(B)-(F)-(C)-(E)-(G)', '(A)-(D)-(H)-(B)-(G)-(E)-(C)-(F)', '(F)-(A)-(D)-(H)-(B)-(G)-(E)-(C)', '(F)-(C)-(A)-(D)-(H)-(B)-(G)-(E)', '(F)-(C)-(A)-(H)-(D)-(B)-(E)-(G)']);
add(R, `다음 대화의 빈칸에 들어갈 말로 알맞은 것은?\n\nA: Mina, ______________________________?\nB: Every day.\nA: Can I run with you today?\nB: Sure, but I suggest you wear running shoes. Your shoes aren't good for running.`, '4', ['how do you go to the gym', 'what time did you start running', 'how long have you been running', 'how often do you come here to run', 'how many hours do you exercise every day']);
