add(R, passage(P, PTSH177, `위 글을 읽고 나눈 대화로 알맞은 것은?`), '2', ['Q: What is the team behind the driver called in car racing? / A: It is called a pit stop.', 'Q: Why does the pit crew have to work in perfect harmony? / A: It is because speed is one of the most important things in a race.', 'Q: Where does the word Sherpa come from? / A: It comes from the name of the place which is located in eastern part of Nepal.', 'Q: Why did mountain climbers start to hire Sherpas? / A: It is because climbers needed to help Sherpas by leading them to the top of the mountain.', 'Q: Why are Sherpa often called the invisible people of Mount Everest? / A: It is because people have never met Sherpas until climbing the Mount Everest.']);
