add(R, passage(P, SH210, `위 글을 읽고 아래 질문에 답할 때, 빈칸에 들어갈 알맞은 말을 본문에서 찾아 각각 쓰시오. (본문에 언급된 순서대로 쓸 것)\n\nQ. What are the three advantages of Sherpas that make mountain climbers begin hiring them?\n\n(1) They ______________________.\n(2) They ______________________.\n(3) They ______________________.`), 'have good climbing skills / know their way around the mountains well / have little difficulty breathing high up in the mountains', null, { subParts: sp(['have good climbing skills', 'know their way around the mountains well', 'have little difficulty breathing high up in the mountains']) });
